SUMMARY:Alphabet Movie Nite
DESCRIPTION:Join the LGBTQ Center of Durham for their monthly Alphabet Movie Nite. This month\, gather at the LGBTQ Center of Durham Warehouse (118 Hunt Street) for a kids and family movie “Into the Spiderverse!” this Saturday the 30th of May at 6:30pm. \nThere will be seats and popcorn a plenty\, but please bring a blanket or pillow if you are a floor person. Pajamas and stuffies always welcome to make the transition from the movie to the bed that much easier.
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/alphabet-movie-nite/
LOCATION:LGBTQ Center Warehouse\, 118 Hunt Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
END:VEVENT
